{
  "concept": "A sea-facing estate organized as a ceremonial descent from a shaded circular arrival court to a low, broad villa and its horizon terrace. The principal house is a two-storey Caribbean modern composition: a protected landward arrival face gives way to deep ocean-facing living rooms, a long shaded terrace and a reflecting-edge pool. Two detached garden pavilions frame the villa without competing with it: guests occupy the quieter western garden, while wellness occupies the eastern garden. The deliberately compact upper floor concentrates private suites above the arrival wing while preserving the broad sea-facing ground floor for daily indoor-outdoor living. The $15 million ambition is expressed through spatial sequence, generous covered thresholds, estate-scale landscape and separate hospitality/service infrastructure rather than excessive enclosed area.",
  "character": "A sea-facing estate organized as a ceremonial descent from a shaded circular arrival court to a low, broad villa and its horizon terrace. The principal house is a two-storey Caribbean modern composition: a protected landward arrival face gives way to deep ocean-facing living rooms, a long shaded terrace and a reflecting-edge pool. Two detached garden pavilions frame the villa without competing with it: guests occupy the quieter western garden, while wellness occupies the eastern garden. The deliberately compact upper floor concentrates private suites above the arrival wing while preserving the broad sea-facing ground floor for daily indoor-outdoor living. The $15 million ambition is expressed through spatial sequence, generous covered thresholds, estate-scale landscape and separate hospitality/service infrastructure rather than excessive enclosed area.",
